.TH AXFRDNS 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.6.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
axfrdns \- serve DNS zone transfers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B axfrdns
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loads a compiled tinydns database and serves AXFR requests over TCP.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DATA
Database path (default: data.cdb).
.TP
.B IP
Listen address (default: 127.0.0.1).
.TP
.B PORT
Listen port (default: 53).
.TP
.B ALLOW_NETS
Comma-separated client CIDRs (default: 127.0.0.0/8,::1/128).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR axfr-get (1),
.BR axfrdns-conf (1)
